{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19593","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 张汇","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习习和风扇，悠悠淑气微。\n阳升知候改，律应喜春归。\n池柳晴初拆，林莺暖欲飞。\n川原浮彩翠，台馆动光辉。\n泛艳摇丹阙，扬芳入粉闱。\n发生当有分，枯朽幸因依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张汇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}